 <h3><u>Gar ho meri hayaat mere ikhteyar me</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Al-ajal al-ajal ya imam e zamana al-ajal..(2)<br> gar ho meri hayaat mere ikhteyar me, sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> maula ab aap pardae ghaibat uthaiye, do din to zindagi ke guzaru bahar me<br> <br> 1. Is waqt garche adl se khali zameen hai<br> mazloom ke makaan me zalim makeen hai<br> duniya sitam sha’ar hai maghloob deen hai<br> maula zaroor aaenge mujhko yaqeen hai<br> mujhko yaqeen hai..(2)<br> aaegi kuch kami na mere aitbaar me<br> sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> gar ho meri hayaat mere ikhteyar me, sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> <br> 2. Sab log khwahishat ke ab hogaye ghulam<br> Iblisiyat ka daur hai be pardagi hai aam<br> peene lage lahu hai to khane lage haram<br> kehta hai dil ke bus abhi aajaiye imaam<br> aajaiye imaam..(2)<br> gar der hai mashiyat e parwardigaar me<br> sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> gar ho meri hayaat mere ikhteyar me, sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> <br> 3. Mushkil ke waqt humne pukara hai ya husain<br> ghaibat ke imtehaa me sahara hai ya husain<br> qurane ehle bait ka paara hai ya husain<br> haqne hamare dil pe utara hai ya husain<br> utara hai ya husain..(2)<br> reh kar dua e binte nabi ke hisaaar me<br> sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> gar ho meri hayaat mere ikhteyar me, sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> <br> 4. Is daur pur khatar me hai dushwar manzile<br> maula is imtehan me dil ko sukoon de<br> roza namaze haq ke manasik ada kare<br> hum sham karbala ki ziyarat ko jaa sake<br> ziyrarat ko jaa sake..(2)<br> aajaega qaraar dile beqaraar me<br> sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> gar ho meri hayaat mere ikhteyar me, sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> <br> 5. Khud kash hai bam dhamake hade zulmo jaur hai<br> kuch saamne hai aur pase manzar kuch aur hai<br> abhi yazidiyat ke mazalim ka taur hai<br> garche ye momineen pe mushkil ka daur hai<br> mushkil ka daur hai..(2)<br> duniya ke dard o ghum hai bhala kis shumaar me<br> sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> gar ho meri hayaat mere ikhteyar me, sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> <br> 6. Ehle aza ko jur'at o tadbeer chahiye<br> dekha hai khwab khwab ki tabeer chahiye<br> taskeen qalbe madar e shabbir chahiye<br> ab jannat ul baqi ki tameer chahiye<br> tameer chahiye..(2)<br> ajaegi bahar is ujde dayaar me<br> sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> gar ho meri hayaat mere ikhteyar me, sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> <br> 7. Alfaaz se dilo pe hukumat mili mujhe<br> mazlumiye husain se taqat mili mujhe<br> mimbar mila husain ka izzat mili mujhe<br> badle me ek ashk ke jannat mili mujhe<br> jannat mili mujhe..(2)<br> ghaata kabhi hua nahi is karobaar me<br> sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> gar ho meri hayaat mere ikhteyar me, sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> <br> 8. Dar par tumhare hote hai har roz mojize<br> kitne ameer hogaye is dar ki bheek se<br> sab apne apne hisse ki khairat le gaye<br> zikre imame asr me hissa qamar mile<br> hissa qamar mile..(2)<br> mai mutma'in hu mai bhi khada hu qataar me<br> sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> gar ho meri hayaat mere ikhteyar me, sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me<br> sadiya guzar dunga tere intezar me..(3)</p> 
